<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 323 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 323 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 323 million zlotys of 273-day National Bank of Poland bills against a 200 million zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
